#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:9
msgid "构建与镜像合同"
msgstr "Build and image contracts"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:11
msgid "一份作者 TOML、一个不可变配置 IR、一个静态 bundle 与一个 CMake 软件图共同描述所选平台。产品源码与组合由外部工程拥有。"
msgstr ""
"One authored TOML file, one immutable configuration IR, one static bundle, "
"and one CMake software graph describe the selected platform. External "
"projects own product source and composition."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:13
msgid "输入与发布"
msgstr "Inputs and publication"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:15
msgid ""
"配置是单写者事务：先保护作者输入、事实和配置代码，再变更拥有的输出。拒绝或中断不得把上一份输出暴露为当前配置。相同生成内容保留字节和时间戳；配置摘要不替代编译器或生成器源码身份。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration is a single-writer transaction: protect authored inputs, "
"facts, and configuration code before modifying owned outputs. Rejection or "
"interruption must not expose the previous output as the current "
"configuration. Identical generated content retains its bytes and timestamps;"
" a configuration digest does not replace compiler or generator source "
"identity."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:17
msgid ""
"CMake 拥有源文件列表和 target 依赖。包、事实、binding、公共配置代码闭包与组件登记都是明确输入。包导出声明只定义 Source "
"SDK 的生产归属，不建立第二份编译图。"
msgstr ""
"CMake owns source lists and target dependencies. Packages, facts, bindings, "
"the common configuration-code closure, and component registration are "
"explicit inputs. Package export declarations define production ownership for"
" the Source SDK; they do not establish a second compilation graph."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:19
msgid "公开接入"
msgstr "Public integration entry points"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "API/目标"
msgstr "API/target"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "合同"
msgstr "Contract"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "`find_package(Nexus CONFIG REQUIRED)`"
msgstr "`find_package(Nexus CONFIG REQUIRED)`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "验证所选来源并加载函数；请求版本时仅接受精确匹配；不创建装配"
msgstr ""
"Validate the selected source and load functions; accept only an exact match "
"when a version is requested; do not create an assembly"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "`nexus_add_platform(ASSEMBLY ...)`"
msgstr "`nexus_add_platform(ASSEMBLY ...)`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "显式建立唯一完整平台"
msgstr "Explicitly create the single complete platform"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "`nexus_add_runtime(ASSEMBLY ...)`"
msgstr "`nexus_add_runtime(ASSEMBLY ...)`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "显式建立 CPU Runtime 库；与 Platform 互斥"
msgstr ""
"Explicitly create a CPU Runtime library; mutually exclusive with Platform"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "`nexus_add_firmware()`"
msgstr "`nexus_add_firmware()`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "为该装配创建镜像、启动对象和产物规则"
msgstr "Create an image, startup objects, and artifact rules for the assembly"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "`nexus_apply_firmware_policy(target)`"
msgstr "`nexus_apply_firmware_policy(target)`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "Runtime 自建 executable 显式采用最终镜像策略"
msgstr ""
"Explicitly apply final-image policy to an executable created by a Runtime "
"consumer"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "`Nexus::ABI`、`Nexus::OS`"
msgstr "`Nexus::ABI`, `Nexus::OS`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "分别表示二进制使用要求和所选 OS 后端"
msgstr ""
"Represent binary usage requirements and the selected OS backend, "
"respectively"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:30
msgid ""
"源码和安装 SDK 通过同一私有生产图接入。一个构建目录只允许一个工具链和装配。工具链先于 "
"`project()`；创建平台不能切换编译器。应用不设置平台开发测试或 workload 开关。"
msgstr ""
"Source checkouts and installed SDKs use the same private production graph. A"
" build directory permits only one toolchain and one assembly. Select the "
"toolchain before `project()`; platform creation cannot switch compilers. "
"Applications do not set platform development-test or workload switches."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:32
msgid ""
"SDK 创建后仍可被修改，后续消费边界必须检出变更、来源冲突、expected revision 不符和不允许的开发 "
"fixture。同步边界内可复用已完成工作；持久成功标志、时间戳或父目录 marker 不能替代字节验证。"
msgstr ""
"An SDK can still be modified after creation. Subsequent consumption "
"boundaries must detect changes, source conflicts, expected revision "
"mismatches, and disallowed development fixtures. Completed work may be "
"reused within a synchronous boundary; persistent success markers, "
"timestamps, and parent-directory markers cannot replace byte verification."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:34
msgid "启动、策略与私有要求"
msgstr "Startup, policy, and private requirements"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:36
msgid ""
"Provider target 发布绝对启动源路径 `NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` 与目标 "
"`NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET`。Platform 的 `NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET` 只引用真实 "
"provider。每个镜像各建 startup OBJECT，厂商头、器件宏和 HAL 配置保持私有。"
msgstr ""
"The provider target publishes absolute startup-source paths through "
"`NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` and the target `NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET`. "
"Platform's `NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET` refers only to the actual provider. Each "
"image creates its own startup OBJECT target; vendor headers, device macros, "
"and HAL configuration remain private."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:38
msgid ""
"CPU/FP/enum ABI 对相互链接对象一致。优化、IPO 与 compiler launcher "
"作用于实际编译目标；自有严格诊断与厂商代码分开。运行库、`-nostartfiles`、链接脚本和最终产物规则归 "
"image，不能由公共平台接口泄漏给无关消费者。"
msgstr ""
"CPU/FP/enum ABI settings must agree across linked objects. Optimization, "
"IPO, and compiler launchers apply to the targets that actually compile "
"sources; strict diagnostics for owned code remain separate from vendor code."
" Runtime libraries, `-nostartfiles`, linker scripts, and final-artifact "
"rules belong to the image and must not leak through public platform "
"interfaces to unrelated consumers."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:40
msgid ""
"组件目录拥有自身创建行为。单一登记给出逻辑 ID、入口和 target；绑定公共 API 与私有实现使用要求分别连接。普通组件不为链接目标再创造 "
"TOML 开关。"
msgstr ""
"Each component directory owns its creation behavior. A single registration "
"supplies the logical ID, entry point, and target; public API bindings and "
"private implementation usage requirements are connected separately. Ordinary"
" components do not introduce additional TOML switches for link targets."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:42
msgid "公共 I/O 需求"
msgstr "Common I/O requirements"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:44
msgid ""
"通用 I/O 只消费 `NEXUS_REQUIRED_IO_DOMAINS`。具体模式映射由包 binding 和 typed IR "
"负责，不能给通用图增加 MCU 名称或厂商模式字符串。"
msgstr ""
"Common I/O consumes only `NEXUS_REQUIRED_IO_DOMAINS`. Package bindings and "
"the typed IR own specific mode mappings; MCU names and vendor mode strings "
"must not be added to the common graph."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:46
msgid ""
"`Nexus::IOUART` 提供基础字节 UART、格式检查和必要 wake；word、stream、RS485 为显式扩展。应用在 TOML "
"外装配 RS485 adapter 时也链接其目标。SPI helper 和已选 DMA 路径分别连接真实依赖；ADC stream/group "
"只选相应机制。按真实函数引用与消费者选编，不按文件名猜测。"
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::IOUART` provides basic byte UART, format validation, and necessary "
"wake support; word, stream, and RS485 support are explicit extensions. "
"Applications that assemble an RS485 adapter outside TOML must also link its "
"target. SPI helpers and selected DMA paths each link their actual "
"dependencies; ADC stream/group support selects only the corresponding "
"mechanisms. Select compilation from actual function references and "
"consumers, not filename guesses."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:48
msgid "增量与产物失效"
msgstr "Incremental builds and artifact invalidation"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "变化/事件"
msgstr "Change/event"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "要求"
msgstr "Requirement"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "应用或平台 C 修改"
msgstr "Application or platform C changes"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "只重编真实编译依赖"
msgstr "Recompile only actual compilation dependencies"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "TOML/选中事实/生成器修改"
msgstr "TOML, selected facts, or generator changes"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "重新配置并拒绝陈旧 bundle"
msgstr "Reconfigure and reject a stale bundle"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "生成内容相同"
msgstr "Generated content is unchanged"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "保留文件时间戳，避免无关编译"
msgstr "Preserve file timestamps to avoid unrelated compilation"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "预算或检查器修改"
msgstr "Budget or checker changes"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "重新检查已有 ELF"
msgstr "Check the existing ELF again"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "布局修改"
msgstr "Layout changes"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "触发链接与资源检查"
msgstr "Trigger linking and resource checks"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "BIN/map/资源报告缺失"
msgstr "BIN/map/resource report is missing"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "原固件 target 恢复声明产物"
msgstr "The original firmware target restores declared artifacts"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "配置/链接失败或取消"
msgstr "Configuration or linking fails or is cancelled"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:0
msgid "撤销该次拥有的无效输出，保留真实诊断"
msgstr ""
"Withdraw invalid outputs owned by that invocation and preserve actual "
"diagnostics"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:60
msgid ""
"Ninja 单配置是维护的构建方式。Multi-Config 明确拒绝；其他生成器、Windows/macOS "
"路径或不同工具分发不因代码存在获得集成通过结论。"
msgstr ""
"Single-configuration Ninja is the maintained build configuration. Multi-"
"Config is explicitly rejected. The presence of code for other generators, "
"Windows/macOS paths, or other tool distributions does not establish "
"successful integration."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:62
msgid "命令与目录所有权"
msgstr "Commands and directory ownership"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:64
msgid ""
"完整 checkout 根使用 `python tools/dev/dev.py configure|build|test --preset "
"<name>`。普通命令保留实际退出与过程日志；明确需要镜像来源绑定时选择 `--record-provenance`。"
msgstr ""
"From a complete checkout root, use `python tools/dev/dev.py "
"configure|build|test --preset <name>`. Ordinary commands preserve actual "
"exit codes and process logs; select `--record-provenance` when image source "
"binding is explicitly required."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:66
msgid ""
"受控入口持有 canonical build directory 的同一 kernel "
"lock，覆盖配置、构建、测试及报告发布。同目录独立调用拒绝，不同目录可在总预算内并行。POSIX 嵌套委派实际 "
"descriptor；同线程可重入，其他线程不自动继承。共享一个委派 descriptor 的子阶段由父进程串行协调。Windows "
"嵌套受控执行明确拒绝；直接 CMake/Ninja/CTest 由调用者保证目录独占。"
msgstr ""
"Controlled entry points hold the same kernel lock for the canonical build "
"directory across configuration, building, testing, and report publication. "
"Independent invocations for the same directory are rejected; different "
"directories may run concurrently within the total budget. POSIX nested "
"execution delegates the actual descriptor. The same thread can reenter; "
"other threads do not inherit ownership automatically. The parent process "
"serially coordinates child stages sharing one delegated descriptor. "
"Controlled nested execution on Windows is explicitly rejected; callers "
"invoking CMake/Ninja/CTest directly must ensure exclusive directory "
"ownership."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:68
msgid ""
"进程执行有有限并发与deadline。取消先停止并 join 所拥有的进程，再释放目录锁。工具准备可以明确联网；正常配置、构建与门禁不隐式下载依赖。"
msgstr ""
"Process execution has bounded concurrency and deadlines. Cancellation stops "
"and joins owned processes before releasing the directory lock. Tool "
"preparation may explicitly use the network; normal configuration, building, "
"and gates never download dependencies implicitly."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:70
msgid "验证要求"
msgstr "Verification requirements"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:72
msgid ""
"C/C++ 行为使用实际 GoogleTest/GoogleMock；主机工具使用 "
"unittest。构建图和策略修复需要真实小消费者及产物观察。固件仍为 C11，主机测试 runtime 不进入固件。"
msgstr ""
"C/C++ behavior is tested with actual GoogleTest/GoogleMock; host tools use "
"unittest. Build-graph and policy fixes require real small consumers and "
"artifact observations. Firmware remains C11; the host test runtime does not "
"enter firmware."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:74
msgid ""
"新 Board 验证接线和装配冲突；同 IP 新料号验证器件头、启动向量、缺失外设拒绝、ABI 与内存；新 IP 增加专有 "
"reset/IRQ/DMA/停止失败验证；新家族验证启动合同、私有 SDK、精确器件和外部消费者。已知模型复用不得向公共解析器或图调度器增加 MCU "
"名称分支。"
msgstr ""
"A new Board verifies wiring and assembly conflicts. A new part using the "
"same IP verifies device headers, startup vectors, rejection of absent "
"peripherals, ABI, and memory. New IP adds its own reset/IRQ/DMA/stop-failure"
" verification. A new family verifies the startup contract, private SDK, "
"exact devices, and external consumers. Reusing a known model must not add "
"MCU-name branches to the common parser or graph scheduler."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/build-system.md:76
msgid ""
"验证分别覆盖源码消费者、搬迁只读 SDK、CPU Runtime、所选 F4 目标及 C/C++ 边界；检查实际命令、startup "
"隔离、sections 和资源。重现性结论需要两个新目录、相同源码/工具字节和禁网条件下的实际构建比较，compiler cache 不能替代该结论。"
msgstr ""
"Verification separately covers source consumers, a relocated read-only SDK, "
"CPU Runtime, selected F4 targets, and C/C++ boundaries; it inspects actual "
"commands, startup isolation, sections, and resources. A reproducibility "
"conclusion requires actual build comparisons in two fresh directories with "
"identical source/tool bytes and networking disabled; a compiler cache cannot"
" replace that evidence."
